add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta cpu 0 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT iifgroup 5 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta rtclassid != 42 drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta cgroup 1048577 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT socket wildcard 0 socket transparent 1 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT socket wildcard 0 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT socket wildcard 0 socket transparent 1 meta mark set socket mark accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT socket wildcard 0 meta mark set socket mark
add rule ip ferm INPUT socket wildcard 0 meta mark set socket mark tcp dport 80 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct original ip saddr 192.0.2.1 ct original ip daddr != 198.51.100.1 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct original proto-src 80-90 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct protocol tcp accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct expiration 1m40s accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct expiration 3600s-7200s accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct direction original accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct label 40 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct label & 7 != 7 drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT ah spi 1-1000 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT esp spi 500 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT dccp type { request, response } drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT dccp type != { reset, sync } accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta ipsec exists accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta ipsec missing drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT fib saddr . iif oif != 0 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT fib saddr oif 0 drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT ip option lsrr exists drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT ip ecn not-ect accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp flags cwr accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT log level audit
add table ip6 ferm
delete table ip6 ferm
add table ip6 ferm
add chain ip6 ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT meta l4proto mobility-header mh type binding-update accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT meta l4proto mobility-header mh type != careof-test-init drop
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT hbh hdrlength 8 accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT dst hdrlength 8 accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT rt type 0 rt seg-left 1 accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT exthdr frag exists exthdr mh exists accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT meta l4proto mobility-header accept
